\section{Large-Scale Empirical Study}
\label{sec:empirical}

\subsection{Two-Sided Detection on PSN-IRT Models}
\label{sec:two-sided}

We apply the two-sided framework to 12 models from the PSN-IRT dataset across 5 benchmarks (60 model-benchmark pairs).

